@startuml models
!include theme.iuml
title Crafty — CAD agent rendering and verification loop

start
:Receive durable modeling task\nobjective + input assets + measurements\nparent revision + requested outputs;

repeat
  :CAD agent revises FreeCAD Python\nor requests more evidence of existing geometry;
  :Freeze source / geometry reference\nviews + checks + requested output types;
  :Queue evaluation; lease bounded attempt;
  :Ensure geometry\nreuse live handle / restore native snapshot\nor build explicitly supplied source;

  if (Geometry available?) then (yes)
    :Pin immutable geometry handle; retain snapshot + provenance;
    :Render requested images\ncompute requested numerical checks;
    if (Preview or export requested?) then (yes)
      :Derive requested GLB / STEP\nfrom the same evaluated geometry;
      :Validate export if present;
    endif
    :Record each artifact's availability\nand each check's measured / pass / fail / error state;
    :Release query pin; keep geometry for subsequent evidence;
  else (no)
    :Retain error report and available diagnostics;
  endif

  :Persist evaluation outcome + evidence;
  :Local MCP materializes completed files\ninside the CAD session workspace;
  :CAD agent opens images and reads measurements;
  :Explicitly publish selected evidence by local path\nimmutable result set linked to source revision + run;

  note right
    A publication may contain PNG + metrics JSON only.
    Source revision, evaluation, artifact availability,
    check outcomes, and published results are separate records.
    Existing evidence stays available after a failed iteration.
  end note

repeat while (Revise again within task budget?) is (yes) not (no)

:Return evidence / interpretation / available artifacts\nor clarification request to conversational agent;
note right
  CAD session and task remain recoverable.
  Clarification is answered through the user's chat.
  A final downloadable design includes STEP + source.
  Extra views / metrics / exports reuse ensured geometry.
  An expired handle can be restored from its native snapshot without rebuilding source.
end note
stop

legend bottom
  TRD-21–28: FreeCAD is the rendering and verification service; the CAD agent owns the loop.
  Every commit checks attempt ownership and cancellation. Stop rejects unpublished late results.
endlegend
@enduml
